  "body": "I am privileged to present this premium solid concrete 1980s three-bedroom apartment, perfectly positioned in the vibrant heart of St Heliers. Spanning a generous 130m² of living space, this beautifully maintained home offers an exceptional blend of security, privacy and sunny north-facing living.\r\n\r\nSharing a secure foyer entrance with only one other residence, peace of mind is guaranteed from the moment you step through the security door. Inside, the apartment has been gorgeously maintained and thoughtfully updated over the years. A contemporary color palette perfectly complements the spacious, open-plan living and dining areas, which flow effortlessly out to an expansive, wide deck - the ultimate spot to bask in the afternoon sun. The oversized kitchen offers enough room for an additional casual living or breakfast area on its northern side. Accommodation includes a lovely family bathroom and a private ensuite for the master.\r\n\r\nAn incredible bonus with this concrete apartment is the incredibly large 8.9m x 5.7m garage. This immense space offers enough room for multiple vehicles, a workshop or a jet ski. Other residents in the block have even transformed part of theirs into a gym, wine cellar or the ultimate man cave.\r\n\r\nThe fabulous location needs no introduction! You’ll love living within close reach of St Heliers village, beach, Tennis Club, Bowling Club, library, medical centre, cafes, restaurants - pretty much everything you could ever need.\r\nMaintained to a fastidious standard by a highly proactive, all-inclusive Body Corporate, this property defines effortless, lock-and-leave luxury. Elegant, low-maintenance living awaits - be sure to put this at the very top of your open home list this weekend. Call me!\r\n\r\nPlease visit www.barfoot.co.nz/937319 and scroll down to download or view: Title; LIM (where available); Particulars and Conditions of Sale by Auction (where applicable); and other informative documents",
